<div class="modal fade" id="renderingInstanceModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="renderingInstanceModalLabel" aria-hidden="true" style="z-index: 1056;">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
    <div class="modal-content rounded-xl shadow-2xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="modal-header py-3 px-4 bg-slate-50/80 border-b border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between">
        <h5 class="modal-title d-flex align-items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 m-0 flex items-center gap-2" id="renderingInstanceModalLabel">
          <i class="ti ti-adjustments text-primary text-base"></i>
          <span>Cấu Hình Component: <span class="text-primary font-semibold" id="editRenderingTitle"></span></span>
        </h5>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 transition-colors p-1" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
      </div>

      <form id="renderingInstanceForm">
        <input type="hidden" id="editRenderingUid" />
        <input type="hidden" id="editRenderingId" />
        <input type="hidden" id="editRenderingPlaceholder" />
        <input type="hidden" id="editRenderingSortOrder" />

        <div class="modal-body p-4 text-xs space-y-4">
          <!-- 1. Datasource Setting -->
          <div class="card border border-slate-200/90 rounded-xl p-3.5 bg-slate-50/60 shadow-2xs">
            <label class="form-label fw-bold text-slate-700 font-semibold text-xs d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Nguồn Dữ Liệu (Datasource Item):</span>
              <span class="badge bg-slate-200/80 text-slate-600 font-mono text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">Tùy chọn</span>
            </label>
            <div class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] mb-2.5">
              Nếu không chọn datasource, component trên React Frontend sẽ tự động lấy dữ liệu từ chính trang hiện tại (Context Item).
            </div>

            <div class="input-group input-group-sm flex rounded-md overflow-hidden border border-slate-300 shadow-2xs">
              <span class="input-group-text bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 border-r border-slate-200 flex items-center">
                <i class="ti ti-database text-slate-400 text-xs"></i>
              </span>
              <input type="text" class="form-control text-xs py-1.5 px-3 border-0 focus:ring-0 flex-1 bg-white font-mono" id="editRenderingDatasourcePath" placeholder="(Dùng nội dung của chính trang - Context Item)" readonly>
              <input type="hidden" id="editRenderingDatasourceId">
              <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-0 border-l border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 transition-all duration-150 active:scale-95" type="button" id="btnBrowseDatasource">
                <i class="ti ti-folder-search me-1"></i> Browse...
              </button>
              <button class="btn btn-outline-danger px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-0 border-l border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 transition-all duration-150 active:scale-95" type="button" id="btnClearDatasource" title="Xóa datasource để dùng context item">
                <i class="ti ti-x"></i>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 2. Parameters Configuration -->
          <div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
              <label class="form-label fw-bold text-slate-700 font-semibold text-xs m-0">Tham Số Giao Diện (Parameters):</label>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary py-1 px-2.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-md border border-primary/30 text-primary bg-primary/5 hover:bg-primary/10 transition-all duration-150 active:scale-95 inline-flex items-center gap-1" id="btnAddParameterRow">
                <i class="ti ti-plus text-xs"></i> Thêm Tham Số
              </button>
            </div>

            <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-2.5 bg-white shadow-2xs" style="max-height: 220px; overflow-y: auto;">
              <table class="table table-sm table-vcenter mb-0 w-full text-left text-xs" id="parametersTable">
                <thead>
                  <tr class="text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px] border-b border-slate-100">
                    <th class="pb-2" style="width: 40%;">Tên Tham Số (Key)</th>
                    <th class="pb-2" style="width: 50%;">Giá Trị (Value)</th>
                    <th class="pb-2 text-center" style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">Xóa</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="parametersTableBody" class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                  <!-- Dynamic parameter rows -->
                </tbody>
              </table>
              <div id="emptyParametersNotice" class="text-center py-4 text-slate-400 text-xs italic d-none">
                Chưa có tham số nào được thiết lập. Nhấn "Thêm Tham Số" nếu component cần thông số tùy chỉnh.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-footer py-3 px-4 bg-slate-50/70 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-end gap-2">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-md border border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-all duration-150 active:scale-95" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Hủy</button>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm d-flex align-items-center gap-1.5 inline-flex items-center px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-md shadow-xs transition-all duration-150 active:scale-95 hover:shadow-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40 focus:outline-none" id="btnSaveRenderingInstance">
            <i class="ti ti-check text-xs"></i> Cập Nhật
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

